"    <p>Your site visit has been booked successfully.</p>\n"
"    <p>We will confirm the appointment shortly and notify you through WhatsApp.</p>\n"
"    <p>Thank you for choosing <t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\" />.</p>\n"
"</div>"
